sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Checkout (cliente)
  participant A as LegacyBankAdapter
  participant G as LegacyBankGateway (adaptee)
  C->>A: pay(10.50)
  Note over A: converte reais para centavos<br/>e monta o XML esperado
  A->>G: sendTransaction(1050, "<payer>...</payer>")
  G-->>A: "<response><code>00</code><id>TX-1</id></response>"
  Note over A: interpreta o XML e<br/>devolve um PaymentResult
  A-->>C: { success: true, transactionId: "TX-1" }
